{
  "$comment": [
    "The phone's daily power ledger (T-0582): per day, how long each feature was on, what the battery dropped while it was,",
    "and how hot the phone got. Android does not let an app measure a feature's own draw, so a feature's drop is the",
    "whole phone's unplugged drop shared equally between the features that were on in that interval: an estimate, said so.",
    "The phone keeps it (android-app PowerLedger, the `cases` below), power_report answers `answer` (newest day first),",
    "the console maps it (jarvis-web hud/data/power.ts) into today against yesterday. Readings are taken from the app's",
    "own heartbeats, so a day says how many minutes it covers: that is the honest number, not 24 hours.",
    "Rules: an interval is credited to the features on at its START; a gap past max_gap_s counts as max_gap_s; the",
    "cpu and the drop of a gap past max_gap_s are not credited (nobody knows what ran); the first reading of a day starts that day and credits nothing",
    "(an interval over midnight is not split); a drop is counted only while unplugged at both ends; the peak of a",
    "feature is the hottest reading taken while it was on. A reading is {at, on, cpu_ms, percent, charging, temp_c}."
  ],
  "features": ["wake", "location", "link", "car"],
  "keep_days": 7,
  "max_gap_s": 1200,
  "day_fields": ["date", "covered_min", "cpu_s", "drop_pct", "peak_temp_c", "features"],
  "feature_fields": ["seconds", "drop_pct", "peak_temp_c"],
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "a made-up day: sums per feature, a capped gap, a plugged-in stretch",
      "readings": [
        {"at": "2030-01-10T08:00:00Z", "on": ["wake"], "cpu_ms": 0, "percent": 90, "charging": false, "temp_c": 30.0},
        {"at": "2030-01-10T08:10:00Z", "on": ["wake", "location"], "cpu_ms": 60000, "percent": 88, "charging": false, "temp_c": 32.0},
        {"at": "2030-01-10T08:20:00Z", "on": ["wake", "location", "link"], "cpu_ms": 120000, "percent": 85, "charging": false, "temp_c": 34.5},
        {"at": "2030-01-10T08:30:00Z", "on": ["link", "car"], "cpu_ms": 300000, "percent": 85, "charging": false, "temp_c": 36.0},
        {"at": "2030-01-10T09:30:00Z", "on": ["car"], "cpu_ms": 360000, "percent": 85, "charging": true, "temp_c": 31.0},
